    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Karen Lynn",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112808460719341361109/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKmGqWT1tnUqCyPHaZy3UUYHerAf9lrqWXHbqUxBNItB2D79w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I had to renew my certification. The instructors were good and the training served my purpose. They were thoughtful enough to provide coffee and food to their clients during the training. There might be room for improvement but it is mainly related to the CNESST and COVID issues. You can always provide your feedback on their evaluation form after your class is finished.",
        "time": 1658427145,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dinnia Millette",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117982539784792232432/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUm8XOVBW358BTjBYsMDWjsAr3jmjulTEZ4bVmZTd1S92f-AMt_=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I completed my first aid training for work at Formation Langevin. It was decent overall, but the experience could have been more interesting.\n\nSpending two full days sitting was quite uncomfortable, and the videos presented were really outdated. Given my medical background, I also noticed that some of the information provided wasn't entirely accurate, which sometimes made me doubt the veracity of the content.\n\nOn the other hand, the instructor was dedicated and did his best. In short, the training was decent, but it could benefit from being modernized and made more dynamic.",
        "time": 1757787262,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Daniel Parent",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105914120115085845054/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWa7tUGjBD8vhuod9Rc3YjoLJTfCleTptmo-AAcaZsEIkMKPwUOw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Very bad experience with this company. The first aid training planning process was extremely laborious. It took an inordinately long time to obtain confirmation that an instructor would be available on the requested dates.\n\nOnce this confirmation was received, I validated the availability of all participants and booked a room for the training. Everything finally seemed to be in order. But, to my great surprise, I received a call back to inform me that, after all, there were no instructors available on the agreed dates.\n\nThis is completely unacceptable and deeply unprofessional. Their unreliability wasted everyone's time and resulted in unnecessary expenses. I do not recommend this company for organizing critical training courses such as first aid.",
        "time": 1744119811,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "anna siliana doiron",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114508652659693116958/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXaK3NPBbcG0C173Bvo9zuWmMjKo3rKy3Q_uU5syFyK0maGXLs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "This is my second time taking the course. The first time, the instructor was less than enthusiastic, but this time, I got the best part!\nBravo, Marcel! I loved my training with you. A man with a big heart, he put us in context with several accidents that have crossed his path throughout his life! It was very informative and proactive. We laughed a lot and had a lot of fun! Keep up the great work, see you again in 3 years!\n\nI highly recommend it! I loved my experience 🙂",
        "time": 1723857931,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Elios",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113680161665159260135/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVMCYrBrQotIwDxJpqTIpIN-y0A2WEEWrT1VPllmbEj48VpOw7X=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Super dynamic training, very professional, with participation from everyone as well as great energy from the trainer. I loved it and I would have taken another one even though the course was over and I learned what I needed to learn. Congratulations to Formation Langevin for their motivated, fun, funny, reassuring employee! Thank you Mario for this course! I hope to see you again for the next one.",
        "time": 1637098800,
        "translated": true
      }
    ],
